WEBVTT

00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:13,260
Is it possible to eat too much salad?

00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:20,260
Yeah, so everything is within balance with food here.

00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,260
Well, we've discussed.

00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:27,260
Can a person eat too much salad though?

00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:30,260
So remember, in your three-ring binder,

00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:33,260
there's a section that talks about your greens

00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:37,260
and eating salads can be excellent for you.

00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:44,260
But it depends on what you're choosing for your greens, for instance.

00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:48,260
I really like kale and spinach.

00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:51,260
So if I'm eating my salad with just kale and spinach

00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:54,260
and I'm making kale and spinach smoothies and such,

00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:59,260
kale and spinach have the most ability to increase nitric oxide,

00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:04,260
which you necessarily don't want to do when you have a diagnosis of cancer

00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:12,260
as excess nitric oxide is going to stimulate a vascular interthelial cell growth

00:01:12,260 --> 00:01:16,260
and could increase the growth of a cancer.

00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:19,260
So you don't want to be doing that.

00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:23,260
Access salad if you're even eating leafy greens,

00:01:23,260 --> 00:01:29,260
lettuces, arugula, things like that that aren't necessarily kale.

00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:32,260
Could you eat too much of that?

00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:37,260
Well, you are going to have a lot of methyl groups folate in foliage.

00:01:37,260 --> 00:01:41,260
So yes, you could.

00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:42,260
How much is too much?

00:01:42,260 --> 00:01:43,260
I mean, I don't know.

00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:48,260
I mean, if you're eating six salads a day on a regular basis,

00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:49,260
then maybe you could.

00:01:49,260 --> 00:01:51,260
Can anybody eat too much?

00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:55,260
I don't know if you could possibly do that.

00:01:55,260 --> 00:02:01,260
I have had patients in the past that came to me as strict vegans.

00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:07,260
So I don't think that that lifestyle is necessarily healthy for most people

00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:09,260
for lots of reasons.

00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:13,260
But one of the reasons is you can get excess folate

00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:16,260
and doing so too many methyl groups,

00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:22,260
which is contradictory for a person with a diagnosis of cancer.

00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:24,260
So you would have to be careful about that.

00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:28,260
You can stimulate too much nitric oxide for a person with cancer.

00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:31,260
So everything is within balance.

00:02:31,260 --> 00:02:35,260
So I guess yes, you can eat too much salad.

